            "description": "Traced construction, child registration, weight aggregation and the conversion loop. Whole-parent search located convert.py importing main; its inspected call invokes main after prepare succeeds. The allocator's inherited empty-input division also remains, but the inspected conversion call guards allocation with if linears.",
            "evidence": [
